  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      278.59,
      451.18,
      307.94
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 3 of the Fiscal Management (Responsibility)Act, No. 3 of 2003 by amending paragraphs (e) and (f) thereof and the legal effect of thissection as amended is to revise the objectives underlying responsible fiscal management\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      155.71,
      318.91,
      451.16,
      338.06
    ],
    "text": "(a)by increasing the guarantee limit specified in paragraph (e) up to 15 percent;and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      155.71,
      349.15,
      451.15,
      358.22
    ],
    "text": "(b)by moving the established debt to gross domestic product target, to year 2030.",
